<title>USA: Wall St stocks open lower.</title>
<headline>Wall St stocks open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened lower on Friday, extending a two-day sell-off that has pulled the Dow industrials down by nearly 170 points.</p>
<p>Dow industrials were off 16 points to 6288 and the Nasdaq Composite was down eight at 1290.</p>
